            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>The Minto Recreation Complex - Barrhaven was recently listed by Chatelaine Magazine as one of the <strong>top 10 best indoor pools in Canada</strong>! Read the <a href="https://www.chatelaine.com/living/best-indoor-pools-canada/#gallery/best-indoor-pools-in-canada/3">Best Indoor Pools in Canada article</a>.</p>
<p>The Minto Recreation Complex - Barrhaven&nbsp;includes a six lane, 25&nbsp;metre&nbsp;lap pool with three&nbsp;metre&nbsp;and one&nbsp;metre&nbsp;diving boards, and an access ramp (Pool Rentals, please contact&nbsp;<a href="mailto:mrcb@ottawa.ca">mrcb@ottawa.ca</a>). Two&nbsp;NHL sized ice rinks (one rink is accessible), with accessible change rooms <span dir="ltr">(please email </span><a href="mailto:sports@ottawa.ca" target="_blank"><span dir="ltr">Centralized Allocations </span></a><span dir="ltr">or complete the </span><a href="https://forms.ottawa.ca/en/form/rcfs/parks-facilities/centralized-allocations-booking-form" target="_blank"><span dir="ltr">Centralized Allocations booking form</span></a><span dir="ltr"> for ice rentals).</span></p>
<p>Outside find an artificial turf sports field designed to meet&nbsp;CFL&nbsp;and FIFA design standards <span dir="ltr">(please email </span><a href="mailto:sports@ottawa.ca" target="_blank"><span dir="ltr">Centralized Allocations </span></a><span dir="ltr">or complete the </span><a href="https://forms.ottawa.ca/en/form/rcfs/parks-facilities/centralized-allocations-booking-form" target="_blank"><span dir="ltr">Centralized Allocations booking form</span></a><span dir="ltr"> for field rentals).</span></p>
<p>Artwork suspended from the ceiling named&nbsp;Mr.&nbsp;Kurokawa.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Minto,&nbsp;an active sponsor of community initiatives, is proud to be associated with the City of Ottawa's Community Champions Program.</p></div>
      

